        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hypersonic Assault allows Tachyon to move through Hazard spaces without triggering them. &nbsp;Does this include the space she lands on? &nbsp;For example, let&#39;s say she Hypersonics through an impulsion turret, and stops 2 hexes past the turret, which is still inside its radius of 2. &nbsp;Does that trigger the turret? &nbsp;I&#39;m playing it as &quot;not&quot; for now, which makes her great for BB scenario 2. &nbsp;Hypersonic + Unrelenting makes for painless turret wrecking.</p><p>Final detail - I am also assuming that the Hypersonic effect does not keep her safe from end of the turn Hazard attacks. &nbsp;</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
